title: "Calendar Graph-Fused Sparse PCA"
abstract: >-
  Research software for learning sparse, locally coherent principal components
  from multi-periodic calendar data using graph total variation on a Cartesian
  product of cycle graphs.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Quesada Granja"
    given-names: "Carlos"
    affiliation: "University of Alicante"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-07-26
license: BSD-3-Clause
keywords:
  - sparse PCA
  - graph total variation
  - fused regularization
  - periodic time series
  - multi-seasonal data
  - interpretable representation learning
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.21611751
url: https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.21611751
